<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>8 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>6 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough), Les Ferdinand</p>
<p>(Newcastle), Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>5 - Efan Ekoku (Wimbledon)</p>
<p>4 - Patrik Berger (Liverpool), Matthew Le Tissier</p>
<p>(Southampton), Ole Solskjaer (Manchester United), Andy</p>
<p>Booth (Sheffield Wednesday), Kevin Campbell</p>
<p>(Nottingham Forest), Eric Cantona (Manchester United),</p>
<p>Robbie Earle (Wimbledon), Juninho (Middlesbrough),</p>
<p>Frank Leboeuf (Chelsea)</p>
